5	/**
6	 * Derives an owner's {@code locality}: the canonical region for the owner's city, looked up in a
7	 * fixed city-to-region table (Sydney -> NSW, Melbourne -> VIC, Brisbane -> QLD). Any city not in the
8	 * table (including a null or blank city) derives {@code "UNKNOWN"}. The mapping is pinned so it is
9	 * stable across requests and needs no persisted column.
10	 */
11	public final class Locality {
12	
13	    /** City -> canonical region; anything not listed derives locality "UNKNOWN". */
